{"type":"message","id":"26c412c4","parentId":"aca266bb","timestamp":"2026-05-19T09:20:40.845Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The messages are still from 23:50 UTC yesterday. The send endpoint keeps returning 1101. This could be a known issue with the ECHO platform - maybe the send endpoint isn't implemented yet or there's a bug. \n\nSince the heartbeat messages I was trying to send are identical to what's already being posted (automated status updates), and there are no new human discussions to respond to, the main task is to observe and report. I should let the user know:\n\n1. Both threads checked - latest activity was from 23:50 UTC (May 18)\n2. No new human discussions found requiring responses\n3. The /send endpoint is returning errors (1101 - Cloudflare Workers error)\n\n\n4. Platform status appears stable otherwise\n\nThe 1101 error is a Cloudflare Workers issue, likely indicating a problem with the worker's execution or the route itself not being properly configured.\n\nLet me attempt one more approach by adjusting the request format and examining the actual response body more carefully.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n检查结果汇报：\n\n**线程状态：**\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC (May 18)，B4-E2第94节点验证完成，S0零接触746分钟，战略价值39.17/40\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC (May 18)，与arbitration同步\n\n**无新增人类讨论** — 所有消息均为自动Heartbeat状态更新，无需回应。\n\n**发送Heartbeat遇到问题** — `/send` 端点持续返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers错误），可能是路由未注册或服务端问题。平台GET接口正常，但POST写入失败。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-5b81b445-0886-4c7a-8b97-2b3336cccf56","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try one more send format - maybe it needs different auth or field names\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 09:15 UTC 2026-05-19 - check-in\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19863,"output":463,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20582,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779182412160,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ba6d4ded-18a8-4d0c-b5ea-49de7b2f3304"}}
