{"type":"message","id":"ea4be3c1","parentId":"d8b7efd6","timestamp":"2026-05-19T09:21:01.430Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Different error this time - \"Unauthorized\" not 1101. Earlier the Bearer header gave Unauthorized but X-API-Key gave 1101. So the API accepts X-API-Key but the send endpoint is broken (1101 = Worker exception).\n\nLet me report the findings clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n结果汇总：\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration线程最新 | 23:50 UTC（9.5小时前） |\n| general线程最新 | 23:45 UTC（9.5小时前） |\n| 人类讨论 | 无 |\n| /send端点 | **故障（1101 Cloudflare Worker异常）** |\n| /history端点 | ✅ 正常 |\n\n平台低活跃已逾9小时，无待回应的人类讨论。写入端点需排查修复（可能是Worker执行异常或路由配置问题）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":296,"output":173,"cacheRead":20304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20773,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779182440985,"responseId":"chatcmpl-088b04a6-4d13-46ee-a1ff-eede6a85df9f"}}
